Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.92,0:00:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Long ago, Gold Roger,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.96,0:00:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,the King of Pirates, obtained\Neverything the world had to offer,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.54,0:00:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,and his dying roads drove\Ncountless souls to the seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.38,0:00:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You want my treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.90,0:00:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.18,0:00:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I left everything in one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.92,0:00:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.24,0:00:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And thus a new age began.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.08,0:00:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.22,0:00:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm done playing\Nthrough with the waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.54,0:00:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, I'm feeling alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.46,0:00:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.60,0:00:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.86,0:00:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise your flag up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.48,0:00:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hail a brand new dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.40,0:00:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Blaze across the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.92,0:00:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to journey on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.92,0:00:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,On your mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.40,0:00:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Camel of other things.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.30,0:00:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on Earth. A legendary!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.18,0:00:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.10,0:00:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can show your breath,\NThen we'll make some waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.90,0:01:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We run our daunted.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.46,0:01:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't no beginners.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.70,0:01:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause if you're wanted,\NThen you're a winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.44,0:01:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,For we are on the cruise,\NAnd freedom is the only rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.78,0:01:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Fearless night and day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.36,0:01:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause that's just our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.90,0:01:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Find one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.28,0:01:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be the first.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.62,0:01:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll put it be so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.88,0:01:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a bit first.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.79,0:01:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all this real.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.22,0:01:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be cause my hand's on a wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.00,0:01:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done playing, filled with the waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.52,0:01:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,In a world I'm feeling\Nalive, but I'll be loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.22,0:01:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.66,0:01:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We have come so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.52,0:01:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta make it to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.94,0:01:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever danger we find,\Nno one ever left behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.76,0:01:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I've always got your back, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.54,0:01:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sail on shoreward, keep marching forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.54,0:01:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming from the very\Nfirst day I'd make my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.20,0:02:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't you know that\Ndream hasn't changed?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.92,0:02:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done playing through with the wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.40,0:02:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,In every world I'm feeling alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.36,0:02:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out below.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.66,0:02:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.36,0:02:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.40,0:02:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.26,0:02:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.26,0:02:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.86,0:02:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.90,0:02:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Please! Stop him!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.96,0:02:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He's getting away with our money!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.14,0:02:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.40,0:02:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Just stay out of my way, got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.76,0:02:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you don't want to see what I'll\Ndo to this girl if you try to be a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.60,0:02:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.16,0:03:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, don't go that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.60,0:03:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't involve\Nyourself with such a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.44,0:03:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not our responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.18,0:03:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Please wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.09,0:03:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Queen Otohime.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.38,0:03:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.70,0:03:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't come any closer. I'll shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.60,0:03:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I warned you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.34,0:03:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I missed?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.12,0:03:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit, goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.14,0:03:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.40,0:04:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, isn't that Queen Otohime?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.46,0:04:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.70,0:04:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.36,0:04:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Your highness, let me take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.64,0:04:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fractured, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.66,0:04:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,She hit him once and broke her hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.78,0:04:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.88,0:04:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Queen Otohime!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.76,0:04:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.62,0:04:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you do something as foolish and\Nselfish as robbing your fellow people?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.98,0:04:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you care?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.02,0:04:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a rich member of the\Nroyal family could understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.44,0:04:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I got ten kids waiting at home, and all\Nthey do is cry because they're hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.88,0:04:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,All the more reason!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.52,0:04:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Queen Otohime!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.44,0:04:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You must stop hitting him, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.48,0:04:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They're much too delicate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.68,0:04:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You will only make your injury worse!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.72,0:04:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.80,0:04:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.72,0:05:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if my hand must shatter to\Npieces, he will learn his lesson!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.44,0:05:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think your children would\Nbe happy if they knew the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.42,0:05:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If they knew their father was a thief?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.80,0:05:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be trying to live your\Nlife in a way that makes them proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.10,0:05:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,However, I owe you an apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.50,0:05:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.82,0:05:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though I'm your queen,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.64,0:05:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been completely\Nignorant to the hardships
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.26,0:05:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,that one of my subjects\Nhas been forced to endure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.44,0:05:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart can't take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.92,0:05:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Your worries and your\Npain, they're killing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.14,0:05:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You must have had a reason for doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.92,0:05:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.48,0:05:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not that I wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.64,0:05:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But I, I felt like there was no other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.64,0:06:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody sent fire to my\Nstore and stole all my money.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.92,0:06:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We couldn't save anything\Nbefore we hurt down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.56,0:06:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like that, I didn't have a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.40,0:06:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,My debts started piling up,\Nand now my kids are starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.94,0:06:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry that happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.46,0:06:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.06,0:06:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I really do, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.12,0:06:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.02,0:06:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,If you do to others what was done\Nto you, the cycle will never end!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.86,0:06:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.50,0:06:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.16,0:06:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We weren't there for you in your time of\Nneed, so that makes us accountable as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.78,0:06:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.96,0:06:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,it's really not your fault, but that's a\Nterribly generous thing for you to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.34,0:06:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's still wrong, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.92,0:06:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.54,0:06:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Then don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.56,0:06:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You've changed me, and my whole life!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.96,0:06:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much, after seeing\Nhow much you cried for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.62,0:06:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never steal again!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.44,0:06:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that you won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.72,0:06:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Best of luck in the future!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.58,0:06:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We're so lucky to have a member\Nof the royal family who's
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.44,0:06:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,not afraid to share the troubles\Nof common people like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.44,0:07:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,She nearly had me crying along with her,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.64,0:07:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,though I certainly hope she\Ndoesn't break her hand next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.30,0:07:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Our Queen Otohime is a one-of-a-kind\Nruler, I can tell you that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.52,0:07:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,She has such a kind heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.34,0:07:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And look there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.56,0:07:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the children of\Nthe kingdom adore her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.86,0:07:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Queen Otohime!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.98,0:07:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do everything I can to\Nprotect your smiling faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.62,0:07:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Your nose is running terribly!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.70,0:07:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don't reprimand you for it, who will?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.68,0:07:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You look ridiculous with mucus\Ndribbling out of just one side.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.60,0:07:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's more dignified to\Ndribble from both nostrils.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.84,0:07:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a tender moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.24,0:07:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.96,0:07:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No one was more passionate or loving.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.56,0:07:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Every day, Queen Otohime descended\Nfrom the palace to address the nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.24,0:07:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That day was no different.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.38,0:07:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has come for us to relocate\Nthe Ryugu kingdom to the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.78,0:08:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Our skins are different colors,\Nand we do not look the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.76,0:08:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,These are the things the\Nhumans say in order to
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.08,0:08:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,avoid understanding us and\Nour unique way of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.98,0:08:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's why we should move,\Nto understand each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.88,0:08:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Our worlds are 10,000 meters apart,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.46,0:08:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,so that is also the distance\Nbetween our ways of thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.32,0:08:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.52,0:08:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, the humans who come to\Nour island are pirates and criminals.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.36,0:08:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And the humans who buy our people from
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.36,0:08:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,kidnappers like them are\Ncruel and Corrupt nobles
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.26,0:08:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,it's true that our only exposure to humans
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.50,0:08:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,has been negative but That doesn't mean we
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.34,0:08:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,can judge all humans the same I believe in
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.20,0:08:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,my heart That there are\Ngood ones among them
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.02,0:08:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,as well and thus to\Nimprove relations we Must
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.66,0:08:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,move our kingdom to be\Nunder the same Sun it
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.96,0:08:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,is my goal to express our Intention to\Nrelocate above sea level at this year's world
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.74,0:08:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,summit but in order to\Ndo that I Need all of
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.44,0:09:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,you to sign while uh I
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.38,0:09:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,admit it sounds like a
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.50,0:09:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,good idea in theory\Nbut just the thought Of
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.14,0:09:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,living near humans is
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.44,0:09:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,well I understand how
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.76,0:09:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,you feel however this\Nis our chance to make
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.22,0:09:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,a Real change rather\Nthan suffering in silence
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.28,0:09:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Please look I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.00,0:09:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,sorry but no it's no
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.92,0:09:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,use History can't be fought so easily
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.40,0:09:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello everyone, I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.58,0:09:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home, Shirahoshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.00,0:10:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you can forgive me, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.32,0:10:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy didn't mean to be so late!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.66,0:10:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Even with your nose running on\None side, you're still beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.02,0:10:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We stayed with her the entire time you\Nwere gone so she'd feel safe, Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.26,0:10:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true, Mother, we did?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.12,0:10:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I have such brave sons.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.24,0:10:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But what happened to your hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.32,0:10:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.36,0:10:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't worry, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.66,0:10:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.57,0:10:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.49,0:10:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,To ensure you all have a\Nbright future, I would suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.68,0:10:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So much worse than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.64,0:10:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If Queen Otohime wants\Nto make announcements,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.68,0:10:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,she really should do them by video\Nrather than going down there in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.72,0:10:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, thanks to\Nher strong observation Haki,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.28,0:10:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Doing something like that would\Ngo against her very nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.00,0:11:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,She would rather win the hearts of the\Ncitizens in person than from the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.48,0:11:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's one of Otohime's guiding principles.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.60,0:11:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even I can change that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.42,0:11:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,She's constantly putting\Nher life at risk with all
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.04,0:11:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,those human pirates coming\Nand going on the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.66,0:11:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We know you're on good\Nterms with Whitebeard,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.12,0:11:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,and to some extent his influence\Ncan protect her while she's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.66,0:11:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But anything could happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.92,0:11:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That is a fact of which\Nshe is all too aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.74,0:11:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet it does nothing to deter her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.50,0:11:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,For the world Otohime dreams of, it\Nis far more than a simple fantasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.30,0:11:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, unifying our peoples was\Nalso the ambition of our ancestors.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.02,0:11:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Although they were never able\Nto make that vision a reality?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.88,0:11:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.24,0:11:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that I don't\Nfollow your majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.56,0:11:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stop Otohime from\Ndoing what she thinks is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.20,0:11:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's up to you to keep her safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.12,0:11:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.86,0:11:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This Queen Otohime certainly\Nseemed unique, if nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.26,0:12:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like she was a crybaby, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.30,0:12:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you inherit that from her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.44,0:12:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, yes, I suppose I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.94,0:12:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, you used to be a\Nsoldier for the kingdom?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.18,0:12:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,When you grow up in the Fishman District,\Nwhere you know nothing but fighting,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.32,0:12:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,there aren't a lot of career\Npath options available to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.60,0:12:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't say. That's rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.36,0:12:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that where you're from, Hachi?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.66,0:12:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounds like a pretty bad neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.56,0:12:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It was.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.58,0:12:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.62,0:12:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Originally, it was an orphanage for\Nchildren with no living relatives.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.16,0:12:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But in time, the orphanage became too\Nmuch for the administrators to handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.34,0:12:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Before long,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.48,0:12:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,it became a lawless area that caught the
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.48,0:12:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,eye of delinquents from\Nall over the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.88,0:12:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Back then, Fisher Tiger was the\Nclosest thing we had to a leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.86,0:12:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,but he left to have his own adventures.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.26,0:12:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd been his second in command, but\NI went on to join Neptune's army.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.32,0:12:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And despite being fishmen,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.78,0:13:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Macro and some others started\Nhelping the kidnappers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.78,0:13:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,As for everyone else,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.38,0:13:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,they all left, following\Ntheir own pursuits.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.66,0:13:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Until one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.68,0:13:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, give them back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.44,0:13:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you almost had them that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.70,0:13:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.72,0:13:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you realize how hard it was for\Nher to get all those signatures?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.96,0:13:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and you realize I don't care, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.68,0:13:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.30,0:13:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You fishman district reject! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.96,0:13:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you're better than\Nme because of where I'm from?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.84,0:13:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.58,0:13:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it backwards, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.28,0:13:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the captain of the Arlong\NPirates, and you're just a nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.88,0:13:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I clean up all the human\Ngarbage you let run wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.96,0:13:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Pirates so pathetic, they can't\Neven breathe in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.46,0:13:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys in Neptune's\Narmy should be faking us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.92,0:13:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should beat a donation out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.70,0:13:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, I'm in trouble over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.50,0:14:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna kill me, Boss Jinbe. Jinbe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.58,0:14:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.10,0:14:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Just put the rookie down and walk away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.56,0:14:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He's weak, but he's one of my men.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.88,0:14:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And as for those papers you've taken,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.02,0:14:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And they may not mean anything to us, but\Nthey're quite important to her majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.80,0:14:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Give them back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.71,0:14:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Boss G.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.63,0:14:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,May of Neptune's army.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.76,0:14:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.98,0:14:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, they call you Boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.50,0:14:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd you get that kind of respect?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.68,0:14:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds more like the title of a\Ngang leader than a soldier, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.16,0:14:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you to let him go, Arlong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.68,0:14:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.00,0:14:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.92,0:14:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So are we all good now, brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.56,0:14:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.02,0:14:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a while, but I can always tell\Nwhen someone's from the Fistman district.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.74,0:14:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't lump me in with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.72,0:14:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You went off and became a lousy pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.10,0:14:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You're scum.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.12,0:14:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't call me that, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.16,0:14:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how about trash?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.62,0:14:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.76,0:15:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't matter where we're from.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.10,0:15:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't talk to me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.28,0:15:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.19,0:15:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.14,0:15:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.05,0:15:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Fisher Tiger's come home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.10,0:15:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it. Tiger's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.92,0:15:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He's here. Where was the trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.18,0:15:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's brother time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.58,0:15:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally made it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.60,0:15:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, Jinbe. And Arlong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.96,0:15:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It sure looks like you\Ntwo have been doing well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.38,0:15:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That was quite a lengthy voyage you took.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.06,0:15:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, an eventful one, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.06,0:15:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you're here, you can see my ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.34,0:15:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.25,0:15:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I need to go to the Ryugu Palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.52,0:15:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I can show you the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.34,0:15:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He has no need for a lousy pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.58,0:15:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.49,0:15:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not how Big Brother\Nfeels about me at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.38,0:15:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys. Don't fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.02,0:15:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You're telling me you're\Ngoing to free the slaves?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.56,0:15:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stand it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.56,0:15:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The thought of our people living a\Nnightmare even as we're speaking right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.88,0:16:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,our people are being treated like animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.86,0:16:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but my mind's made up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.06,0:16:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, why are you\Nso adamant about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.28,0:16:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you see? on your trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.80,0:16:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw human nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.78,0:16:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Not long after that, Tiger made his move.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.08,0:16:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.34,0:16:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.98,0:16:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, God, I found you, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.82,0:17:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about Tiger. It seems he...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.80,0:17:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,he attacked the Celestial Dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.46,0:17:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that can't be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.02,0:17:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Fischer-Tiger unleashed Alto\Non the Holy Land of Mariegeois.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.68,0:17:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,For freeing the slaves,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.42,0:17:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,he forever became a hero to our people\Nand a criminal to the world government.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.00,0:17:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Consider this my resignation\Nfrom the army. Jinbe!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.40,0:17:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You would walk away from your sworn duty?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.60,0:17:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Much to my surprise, I've enjoyed\Nmy role as this island's protector.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.40,0:17:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,However, my obligation to this kingdom\Ndoes not outweigh my debt of honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.56,0:17:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like Big Brother Ty\Nhas finally made his move.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.40,0:17:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Olog Pirates, from\Nhere on, we work for Whitebeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.78,0:17:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.38,0:17:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Before long,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.82,0:18:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,every ruffian from the fishman district\Nhad assembled a fight by his side.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.54,0:18:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,How does it feel to be lumped\Nin with lousy pirate scum?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.16,0:18:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's us against the world from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.50,0:18:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're truly ready for\Nthe days ahead, then step up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.78,0:18:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,All who accepted the sun mark\Nthat day became brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.22,0:18:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a symbol that enveloped\Nthe brand given to slaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.86,0:18:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No longer could anyone distinguish\Nwhich of us had always been free?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.10,0:18:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And which of us had to fight\Nto reclaim that freedom?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.34,0:18:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's how a bunch of lowlifes\Nfrom the fishbed district rose up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.16,0:18:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,As the sun pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.82,0:18:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe he\Nreally went through with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.18,0:19:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,His actions have only created\Nmore problems for Fishman Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.84,0:19:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It will be quite some time before we'll\Nwelcome back to the world's summit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.28,0:19:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even know where\Nto begin to fix this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.80,0:19:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But we share the blame.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.68,0:19:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, we just couldn't\Nbring ourselves to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.80,0:19:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me why are you so\Nadamant about this. What
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.54,0:19:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,did you see on your\Ntrip I saw human nature
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.64,0:19:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I understood the depth of his
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.72,0:19:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,suffering a scream of his\Nsoul it was unbearable
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.52,0:19:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Extra! Extra!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.82,0:19:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Read all about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.98,0:19:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, he's such a badass.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.00,0:19:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting the Celestial Dragons?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.74,0:19:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk about balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.78,0:19:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that makes it official.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.36,0:19:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Fisher Tiger is a true hero. Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.78,0:19:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,A fish man's gonna wind\Nup in the history books.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.62,0:19:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, gather around.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.68,0:20:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Queen Otohime.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.92,0:20:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.12,0:20:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We have cowered, and hid,\Nand run, and yet for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.70,0:20:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What have we gained from this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.60,0:20:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What good has this path\Ndone for our people?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.90,0:20:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't simply turn our\Nbacks on the entire world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.58,0:20:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,To cut off all humans,\Nit will doom us. Some
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.48,0:20:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,humans are bad yes but not all of them now
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.40,0:20:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,we must learn to live\Nin harmony with humanity
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.04,0:20:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,and together we can grow with them under
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.22,0:20:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,the bright nourishing\Nsun grow with them huh
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.16,0:20:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah that's just too\Nmuch to ask hey you two
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.14,0:20:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sign here, but I can't. I'm sorry.\NPlease, the whole island tied as a hero to
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.54,0:20:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,us for what he did you know it's just\Nwe know his actions might turn the
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.12,0:20:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,humans against us but it's their\Nfault they brought it on themselves so
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.76,0:20:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,we can't sign i know how you feel but\Nin seven years or even 15 years you
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.76,0:21:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,have to think about that future there\Nwill come a day when we will be able
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.24,0:21:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,To participate in the world summit\Nagain, you have to sign for our future.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.54,0:21:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,i'm begging you i'm telling you\Nfisher tiger gets it this is how you
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.32,0:21:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,represent the fishman district he went\Nhead to head with the celestial dragons
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.20,0:21:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,and he freaking won way to stick\Nit to those disgusting humans it's
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.08,0:21:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,just like arlong used to say the\Nonly good human is a dead one yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.60,0:21:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,now put him in their place the\Nsun pirates are so cool i Sailing
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.32,0:21:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,the sea and slamming the docent\Ndown on every dumb human they meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.48,0:21:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's awesome! You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.42,0:21:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If we were a little stronger,\Nthen I bet we could join them!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.22,0:21:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.13,0:21:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, we will!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.20,0:21:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Take back the sea, Sun Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.58,0:21:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill all those worthless humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.58,0:21:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.92,0:22:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, there's an enemy ship! Boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.56,0:22:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.40,0:22:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.78,0:22:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We got a crisis!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.80,0:22:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, Hachi! Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.38,0:22:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.60,0:22:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Just tell us what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.32,0:22:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it the Navy? Must be.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.92,0:22:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,They were flying their flag out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.96,0:22:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.54,0:22:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are the Sun Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.12,0:22:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill Fisher Tiger!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.32,0:22:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.46,0:22:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Real nice aim there!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.28,0:22:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.76,0:22:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.24,0:22:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot them dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.48,0:22:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We're trying, but they're\Nswimming too fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.94,0:23:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon me, gents.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.16,0:23:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You fish-man bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.58,0:23:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Return the slaves, damn it! Surrender!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.96,0:23:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,If you play ball,\Nthey'll drop the charges!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.90,0:23:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We're Admirals!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.38,0:23:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,They're bursting up through\Nthe bottom of the shaft!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.18,0:23:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.76,0:23:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Give us back the slaves and this will end!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.24,0:23:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you even realize the\Nserious crime you've committed?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.12,0:23:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you turn on humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.86,0:23:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Know your place, you disgusting fishmen!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.54,0:23:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.50,0:23:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.54,0:23:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hear you say that again!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.24,0:23:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, somebody help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.92,0:23:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So slavery's perfectly legal,\Nbut freeing slaves is a crime?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.52,0:23:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And Queen Otohime thinks\Nyou deserve a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.02,0:23:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that you'd give us one!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.38,0:24:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.60,0:24:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Blow him to pieces, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.58,0:24:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We know that you're hiding the slaves!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.68,0:24:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And now you're gonna die for\Nthe havoc you've wrought!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.58,0:24:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.44,0:24:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,These slaves mentioned.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.58,0:24:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,He's...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.49,0:24:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,he's a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.20,0:24:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What proof do you possibly have\Nthat we're hiding them on board?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.98,0:24:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on and check all of us if you want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.36,0:24:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But from what I understand, these\Nslaves should have a brand on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.00,0:24:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you see that mark on\Nany of us? Wait! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.24,0:25:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Put me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.74,0:25:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.16,0:25:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't kill you. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.92,0:25:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not a savage like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.96,0:25:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.26,0:25:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Take all their money and food\Nand get back to the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.36,0:25:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Being human is a sin.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.08,0:25:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And so, you were born deserving execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.24,0:25:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.54,0:25:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,DROP DASH!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.00,0:25:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral, Rear Admiral Cutter\Nfrom the G2 branch has been defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.42,0:25:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.48,0:25:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did he engage them?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.80,0:25:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I only wanted to report on\Ntheir current whereabouts.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.42,0:25:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If you get close enough to see them,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.56,0:25:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,well,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.47,0:25:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,that's apparently all it takes before their\Nentire crew surrounds you in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.54,0:26:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.68,0:26:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Fishman, guess we should\Nhave expected that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.02,0:26:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, do you have any intel you can share?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.38,0:26:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, the way it looks, Arlong\Nand his men are part of the crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.00,0:26:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And they were responsible for the raids\Nin the area surrounding Fishman Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.04,0:26:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But we have yet to fight them on land,\Nso it's hard to tell how strong they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.58,0:26:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Arlong?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.49,0:26:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, I've heard of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.70,0:26:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,There's another dangerous\None on their crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.42,0:26:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,He's as big as Fisher\NTiger and just as brutal.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.66,0:26:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't catch his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.18,0:26:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, sounds like a real mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.18,0:26:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow! That hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.10,0:26:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the big deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.54,0:26:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the hell do you care if we kill\None or two of those inferior creatures?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.16,0:26:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.70,0:26:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You're both going too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.64,0:26:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, we're not a group of killers.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.34,0:26:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We're better than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.76,0:26:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't you forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.24,0:26:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But look, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.84,0:27:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I mean boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.44,0:27:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,These humans have no such compunction.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.88,0:27:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,They are actively out to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.70,0:27:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So can you blame us?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.34,0:27:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course we might go too far\Nfrom time to time. We're mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.42,0:27:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to be like the humans?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.42,0:27:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Killing someone is to kill\Na part of your own soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.20,0:27:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We are not seeking revenge\Nfor the discrimination here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.50,0:27:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's not what Marie\NJoie was about either.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.44,0:27:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I might have broken that\Nstupid unspoken rule,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.96,0:27:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,but I only did it to free those slaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.08,0:27:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The Sun Pirates are driven by the\Nidea of liberation and freedom,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.86,0:27:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,not spiteful retribution.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.22,0:27:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Seeking vengeance against the\Nhumans only creates a vicious cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.62,0:27:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Violence begets violence, and I will\Nnot be responsible for more tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.46,0:27:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll end up condemning the next\Ngeneration of fishmen to war with humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.42,0:27:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.14,0:27:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We will fight and rob those who come\Nafter us, but we won't cross the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.76,0:27:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We will not become killers.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.42,0:28:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.80,0:28:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you're overlooking\None simple fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.82,0:28:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Violence always begets violence, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.94,0:28:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, not if they're all dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.84,0:28:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's gonna fight back if we kill them?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.74,0:28:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll massacre the animals and force\Nall the women and children to watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.50,0:28:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Terrifying the idea of revenge\Nright out of their minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.58,0:28:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,All we have to do is show them how\Npowerful and ruthless we can be and then
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.90,0:28:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,they'll be paralyzed with terror they\Nwill never what the hell is your problem
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.32,0:28:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's great what Queen Otohime is trying to
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.72,0:28:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,accomplish, though\Nunderstandably, to for her,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.20,0:28:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,there's no difference\Nbetween Arlong and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.52,0:29:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, there's only one\Nthing that I'm really afraid of.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.02,0:29:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My own mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.86,0:29:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Up ahead, there's a pirate ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.66,0:29:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like a big one.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.42,0:29:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm guessing they want to take\Nus on to prove themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.06,0:29:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We are really racking up the enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.78,0:29:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I say we seek their ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.18,0:29:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Best to make an example of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.48,0:29:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We were engaged in\Ncombat on a daily basis.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.30,0:29:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Criminals hunted by the world government.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.46,0:29:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, Queen Otohime waged her own\Nstubborn form of battle against the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.68,0:29:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Sign here!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.74,0:29:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.14,0:29:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't want to live with humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.06,0:29:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Please sign!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.48,0:29:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.58,0:29:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The government put out a\Nbounty on Boss Tai and Jinbe!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.14,0:29:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.36,0:29:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, 230 million bearings!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.06,0:29:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinbei's got 76 million on his head!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.46,0:29:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanted posters!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.92,0:30:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, they raised the\Nreward on them again!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.64,0:30:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the world government\Nis scared of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.08,0:30:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.06,0:30:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gonna sink the entire navy!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.66,0:30:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to sign it!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.60,0:30:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go, your majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.94,0:30:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,See the next three years unfolded in\Na similar manner, and then one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.04,0:30:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,we came across a young girl on an\Nisland Mister we could use your help
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.12,0:30:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,With something this girl here, she\Nescaped from Marie Joie with the
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.42,0:30:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,rest of us back when you liberated\Nus from slavery three years ago here
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.02,0:30:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Look
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.12,0:30:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,She hasn't seen her parents in many years\NAnd her home's far away We would like to
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.14,0:30:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,help I'm sure they miss her But it's highly\Ndoubtful we can safely cross the ocean
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.50,0:30:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Koala and I'm 11 years\Nold Thanks for saving
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.26,0:30:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,me I'll do my best not to\Ncause you any more trouble
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.18,0:30:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I know she's a kid But\Nshe's still a disgusting
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.86,0:31:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,human Why the hell would you\Nlet her on board with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.00,0:31:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Just drop it, Orlang.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.88,0:31:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll drop this ugly brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.06,0:31:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit smiling, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.48,0:31:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Orlang, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.18,0:31:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.62,0:31:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go, Hachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.72,0:31:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not done yet! He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.14,0:31:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It is creepy how she won't stop smiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.32,0:31:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? You?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.38,0:31:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.38,0:31:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.29,0:31:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a hard worker.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.72,0:31:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll clean, and I don't\Nneed to take a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.22,0:31:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So please don't hit me. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.68,0:31:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.00,0:31:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give it my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.22,0:31:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.36,0:31:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.80,0:31:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.22,0:31:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll clean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.88,0:31:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.70,0:31:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.86,0:31:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise that I'll never cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.58,0:31:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Just please don't kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.86,0:32:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.22,0:32:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you scared of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.32,0:32:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but I really miss my mother,\Nso I made myself get on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.76,0:32:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't stop cleaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.66,0:32:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I know if I do, you'll think\NI'm useless and kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.00,0:32:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm a hard worker,\Nso please let me live.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.36,0:32:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what'd you expect?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.98,0:32:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The kid was raised a slave.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.66,0:32:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about what she's seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.64,0:32:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure plenty of her friends got killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.46,0:32:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And probably just for crying or\Ngetting caught taking a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.26,0:32:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,She's spent her whole life being\Nafraid that she might be next.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.78,0:32:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you blame her for not trusting anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.78,0:32:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.72,0:32:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Pick up this brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.22,0:32:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I want her brought to my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.12,0:32:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he doing in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.88,0:32:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Lecturing her won't do any good.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.54,0:32:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The poor kid's too far gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.16,0:33:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, what are you doing to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.78,0:33:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Bandage her.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.06,0:33:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It may have hurt,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.30,0:33:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,but she'd never get past the pain of\Nbeing a slave with that mark on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.84,0:33:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, kid, you still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.94,0:33:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, good, you're awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.22,0:33:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I guess I passed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.74,0:33:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I didn't cry, did I?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.34,0:33:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So you don't need to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.60,0:33:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise you, I'll never cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.56,0:33:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So please, let me live.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.14,0:33:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay for you to cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.82,0:33:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We are nothing like those\Nevil celestial dragons
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.74,0:33:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,so don't you dare act\Nlike we are now watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.70,0:34:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.30,0:34:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Not now, not ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.46,0:34:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Is everyone with me? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.52,0:34:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how far the journey,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.50,0:34:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,we're taking this girl back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.22,0:35:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
